From a52df653649558fbfc14cbb22b6abda85d15714e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Vikrant Yadav <vikrantyadav4802@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 15:56:33 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] pinctrl: airoha: fix bias readback in airoha_pinconf_get()

In airoha_pinconf_get(), the final "else if (pull_up || pull_down)" branch
lacks a PIN_CONFIG_BIAS_DISABLE check, causing valid pull-up/pull-down
readbacks to fail with -EINVAL. Guard the branch on PIN_CONFIG_BIAS_DISABLE.

Origin: upstream, https://github.com/u-boot/u-boot/commit/a52df653649558fbfc14cbb22b6abda85d15714e
Signed-off-by: Vikrant Yadav <vikrantyadav4802@gmail.com>
---
 drivers/pinctrl/airoha/pinctrl-airoha.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/pinctrl/airoha/pinctrl-airoha.c b/drivers/pinctrl/airoha/pinctrl-airoha.c
index 6245f116bd22..093a6c05f659 100644
--- a/drivers/pinctrl/airoha/pinctrl-airoha.c
+++ b/drivers/pinctrl/airoha/pinctrl-airoha.c
@@ -350,7 +350,7 @@ static int airoha_pinconf_get(struct airoha_pinctrl *pinctrl,
 		else if (param == PIN_CONFIG_BIAS_PULL_DOWN &&
 			 !(pull_down && !pull_up))
 			return -EINVAL;
-		else if (pull_up || pull_down)
+		else if (param == PIN_CONFIG_BIAS_DISABLE && (pull_up || pull_down))
 			return -EINVAL;
 
 		arg = 1;
